						 <p>I'm glad you liked the article and thanks for the upvote!</p> <p>Indeed, this was the article that introduced the Fascist Council of the Occult. As of today, there are several other articles that mention this GoI and develop it further; you can find them (along with more details) on the -IT branch and on its hub on the -INT site.</p> 
