				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Mon, 15 Oct 2018 12:04:03 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>RhettSarlin</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>300030</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>Nice start to a story there it seems. You'd probably want to continue that, expanding the presence of the CFO and showing what they're up to etc. Object itself is somewhat interesting. Genetically engineered organism. Doesn't seem to necessarily have anything paranormal about it but it's definitely a threat that would have to be contained. Good enough for an upvote, I hope to see more along this line.</p> 
				 	]]>
